      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CO CAPTAIN (1) is a progressive colt who led and kept going to score by 1.2m at this circuit and distance last time, his third success from his last four outings. Has the speed to take full advantage of the inside draw so can do it again. BOULEVARD BART (2) led from this draw and boxed on okay at Terang last start. He is unbeaten here, working from wider but proving too good two back, and has won all three tries at this distance. TOOLIJOOA BEACH (3) is another coming back in grade and he is aided by a good draw. MESSERATI (7) draws wide but this is the lowest-graded race he has encountered for some time so should enjoy the class drop.",
